The genotype associations may also show up in a plot of pairwise recombination fractions using est.rf() <https://search.r-project.org/CRAN/refmans/qtl/html/est.rf.html> and then plotRF() <https://search.r-project.org/CRAN/refmans/qtl/html/plot.rf.html>.
With so many markers, you may want to plot just a few chromosomes at a time.

karl

